{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20266iqnKiwwpW1793157114.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>網上近日流傳一段影片，事發地點位於紅磡黃埔街1號必嘉坊一間連鎖餐廳旁邊的後巷。片中直擊後巷竟有十多隻老鼠集體出沒覓食；與此同時，旁邊連鎖餐廳內的食客正密密開餐，上演一幕「你有你食，我有我食」的奇觀，令人側目。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-28-11h07m06s866.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026XcdkqZnoPU1793157076.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>這段影片隨即引爆網絡熱議，大批網民指鼠患問題離譜，直呼「好恐怖」，更有不少網民調侃留言：「老鼠自由行」、「多到呢！」及「一家大細出晒嚟」。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-28-11h07m12s968.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ztft7zIjG81793157084.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>區議員林德成在社交網發文，指已知悉必嘉坊餐廳側巷的鼠患事件並即時跟進。林德成指已即時聯絡食環署總監、商場管理公司代表及物管負責人到場實地視察，即場要求商場管理公司加強日夜巡查、定期滅鼠及規範垃圾收納，從源頭杜絕衛生問題；同時亦要求食環署對該餐廳展開突擊覆檢，並加密巡查頻次，確保環境衛生符合標準。</p><p><p><img alt=\"868005829_1825659551970336_1970106455318180509_n.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026JzihVsNwN91793157651.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p><p>區議員林德成社交網圖片</p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T04:21:21.106518+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":335,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T03:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T19:38:12.699777+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T04:18:23.865832+00:00","content_hash":"3ccf2491a9fca724fc0cf3fd5c0e11e4d66454c54efb62cc9742e8be6c53062c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T04:21:21.106518+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}